WEBVTT

00:13.940 --> 00:18.180
Please make haste and come back, my master.

02:02.940 --> 02:06.750
My face looks weird, come take a look.

02:08.010 --> 02:09.440
When was this picture taken?

02:09.830 --> 02:12.200
Ah, that was when we had our field trip.

02:12.200 --> 02:14.440
It was so fun.

02:15.000 --> 02:17.600
Ah, Hiiragi-senpai was attacked.

02:17.600 --> 02:22.570
He fell behind when the reindeer passed by, it was a rather sad moment for Hiiragi Renji.

02:23.040 --> 02:24.930
Good old days.

02:24.930 --> 02:30.560
Anzelotte came right after this happened and took Hiiragi away with her.

02:30.560 --> 02:36.120
Hey you guys, stop digging out others' trauma and start working!

02:36.120 --> 02:38.720
At this rate, we'll never finish cleaning this place up!

02:43.840 --> 02:46.480
These just brings back so many memories, I just...

02:46.480 --> 02:49.250
Everything here belongs to you right?

02:50.850 --> 02:54.320
Can we really get this place cleaned up before you graduate?

02:55.000 --> 02:56.150
We'll do something about it!

02:56.150 --> 02:59.300
This is for the sake of both you and Elis-chan, who will inherit this place, right?

02:59.300 --> 03:00.930
I'm going to graduate as well!

03:00.930 --> 03:03.000
Can you really do that, graduate?

03:08.210 --> 03:10.370
Is it okay to throw this away?

03:13.110 --> 03:15.990
Ah, that's from last year's school festival.

03:15.990 --> 03:17.610
I still have that?

03:17.610 --> 03:18.690
Toss it, toss it.

03:18.690 --> 03:21.000
Akarin, can you help me with it?

03:21.000 --> 03:23.270
Ready...

03:25.840 --> 03:27.970
I'm going to throw the garbage out!

03:27.970 --> 03:29.810
Bye!

03:43.490 --> 03:45.160
Elis, what's wrong?

03:46.560 --> 03:47.820
It's calling for me.

04:15.210 --> 04:20.750
Anzelotte-sama, we have confirmed a disorder in the gravitational field inside Kimei Academy's Astronomy Club room.

04:20.750 --> 04:22.220
A disorder in the gravitational field?!

04:22.220 --> 04:27.070
It's probably a distortion inside the space-time continuum that resembles a dimensional network, but the size is unknown.

04:27.960 --> 04:32.070
Hiiragi Renji and Shiho Elis are confirmed to have been trapped inside the disorder.

04:32.070 --> 04:34.070
Please analyze it in greater detail at once.

04:34.070 --> 04:34.760
Yes.

04:39.740 --> 04:40.880
Elis!

04:41.440 --> 04:43.420
Hiiragi-senpai!

05:04.740 --> 05:06.000
Where is this place?

05:08.380 --> 05:10.140
Hiiragi-senpai...

05:10.140 --> 05:11.540
Hiiragi-sen-!

05:13.530 --> 05:16.400
Don't tell me, the jewel is somewhere near here...

05:16.400 --> 05:18.130
What is the meaning of this?

05:18.760 --> 05:24.090
Why is this girl the one being called instead of the master?

05:25.290 --> 05:31.300
I wonder if there is still something missing, even with all of this Plannar I've gathered here.

05:31.680 --> 05:32.790
You're...!

05:33.970 --> 05:36.350
That is... the Jewel of Seven Virtues!

05:58.040 --> 05:59.610
I see.

05:59.610 --> 06:04.960
So it rejected my summoning and instead calls for another, huh?

06:05.600 --> 06:10.530
The jewels you have and the Jewel of Justice that I have here.

06:13.890 --> 06:16.650
The Jewel of Justice...

06:26.480 --> 06:29.250
Just where the heck is this place?

06:29.740 --> 06:31.980
Where did I end up at?

06:33.070 --> 06:34.200
Where is Elis?

06:34.200 --> 06:35.210
Elis!

06:37.420 --> 06:40.260
Hey you, where do you think you're going?

06:47.010 --> 06:49.010
WORK!!

06:49.010 --> 06:53.160
Work for the tower that will represent our god!

06:53.160 --> 06:57.260
Support it with your life and power!

07:04.830 --> 07:07.990
Hey, you, the one with the weird clothes!

07:07.990 --> 07:09.860
Put more strength into your hip! Your hip!

07:11.120 --> 07:14.280
Wait a minute, why am I doing something like this?!

07:14.280 --> 07:17.330
Don't stop!!

07:20.840 --> 07:24.470
Y-You, are you trying to go against me?!

07:24.470 --> 07:30.340
Disobeying my orders also means that you are disobeying the orders of the Sorceress Amy!

07:30.340 --> 07:31.930
Sorceress, you said?

07:31.930 --> 07:36.380
If you're talking about an Emulator, I have nothing to hold back!

07:36.380 --> 07:39.570
I'll take care of them, everyone else, run!

07:41.100 --> 07:44.020
No need to hold back! Kill him!!

07:50.740 --> 07:51.830
I see.

07:51.830 --> 07:58.740
So that Sorceress Amy is the one controlling the people here, and using them to build that tower, huh?

07:58.740 --> 08:00.250
Y-Yes...

08:00.750 --> 08:03.560
What the hell is that tower anyway?!

08:03.560 --> 08:07.370
She said the tower is for the calling of the great gods.

08:08.270 --> 08:12.170
Amy-sama called it the Tower of Babel.

08:12.170 --> 08:14.270
The Tower of Babel?

08:20.350 --> 08:21.740
Hello?

08:21.740 --> 08:23.220
Anzelotte?!

08:23.220 --> 08:26.610
It seems that you are alright, Hiiragi-san.

08:26.610 --> 08:31.490
Yeah, are you the one who flew us here?!

08:31.490 --> 08:37.280
What? There is no way I would do such a terrible thing to you!

08:37.280 --> 08:42.000
I swear! Absolutely, come what may, there is no way!

08:42.500 --> 08:43.850
Forget it.

08:43.850 --> 08:45.750
Explain to me what's going on.

08:45.750 --> 08:47.930
Calm down and listen well.

08:47.930 --> 08:50.240
Both you and Elis are...

08:50.240 --> 08:55.970
Thrown back to an alternate version of the year 5000 B.C.

08:55.970 --> 08:57.420
What's that supposed to mean?

08:57.420 --> 08:59.510
Aren't you surprised?

08:59.510 --> 09:05.810
The people here said they were building something called the Tower of Babel. That was some old story from around here right?

09:06.540 --> 09:11.550
We think this Tower of Babel is something that was created by the Emulator.

09:12.250 --> 09:18.320
Also, the distortion in the space-time continuum that pulled you there was probably created by the Emulator as well.

09:18.320 --> 09:22.450
We're guessing it is a form of Summoning Magic, performed by a Witch.

09:23.000 --> 09:26.870
So why did it bring us here?

09:26.870 --> 09:29.000
We still don't know about that.

09:29.000 --> 09:31.500
This may just be a simple accident.

09:31.500 --> 09:37.300
What's clear is, if you can defeat the Emulator that activated the spell...

09:37.760 --> 09:42.190
the effect of the magic should wear off, and send you back to present time.

09:42.190 --> 09:43.500
Something like that.

09:44.010 --> 09:45.220
Understood.

09:45.220 --> 09:48.270
Guess I'll just go kick that Witch's ass and head home.

09:49.550 --> 09:51.740
Do you know where Elis is?

09:52.260 --> 09:56.760
I think Elis-san is somewhere near the top floor of the Tower of Babel.

09:56.760 --> 09:58.490
As I expected.

09:59.200 --> 10:02.020
It would be bad if she meets with the Witch.

10:02.020 --> 10:07.500
We've also confirmed the reaction from not only an Emulator but from one of the jewels.

10:07.500 --> 10:09.900
Please hurry, Hiiragi-san.

10:09.900 --> 10:11.710
Hey, what's wrong?!

10:12.070 --> 10:15.980
It looks like calling through dimensions is taking its toll on us.

10:15.980 --> 10:17.090
Hiiragi-san.

10:17.090 --> 10:18.530
Hello!

10:19.740 --> 10:21.720
The battery gave out, huh?

10:23.720 --> 10:25.100
No choice but to go then.

10:36.990 --> 10:41.240
So it's not just another tower made of stone like it seems.

10:42.130 --> 10:44.490
What the hell is this place?

11:14.510 --> 11:16.190
You think I'm going to fall for the same thing twice?!

11:49.260 --> 11:50.690
Kirihito?!

11:51.840 --> 11:54.280
Even though this is actually against the rules.

11:54.280 --> 11:55.440
Something like this.

12:00.500 --> 12:04.770
You sure were taking a long time for such weak creatures...

12:04.770 --> 12:06.070
Hiiragi Renji.

12:06.070 --> 12:07.220
Kirihito!

12:07.220 --> 12:09.030
Why are you here?!

12:09.030 --> 12:11.760
We have no time for idle talk.

12:11.760 --> 12:14.670
Elis will be in danger if we don't hurry.

12:15.330 --> 12:17.380
H-Hey, Wait!

12:25.340 --> 12:28.530
Geez, always making these sudden appearances.

12:28.530 --> 12:30.560
Just who the hell are you?!

12:31.050 --> 12:35.210
That uniform looks like it's from Kimei Academy's Middle School.

12:35.210 --> 12:38.270
And I don't get the impression that you're following Anzelotte's orders...

12:39.090 --> 12:42.820
I am simply one who watches over Elis.

12:47.030 --> 12:50.120
Listen, Elis is just beyond here.

12:50.900 --> 12:55.750
Elis is being held captive on the top floor of that tower.

12:56.540 --> 13:00.710
I'll leave saving her and dealing with the Witch Amy to you.

13:01.270 --> 13:02.850
Don't just decide on your own!

13:02.850 --> 13:03.920
We don't have much time!

13:04.730 --> 13:09.250
I'll stop the function of this tower while you are inside.

13:09.760 --> 13:10.550
Please.

13:14.190 --> 13:16.600
What the hell is this tower anyway?

13:17.360 --> 13:21.020
The tower itself is a huge summoning mechanism.

13:21.020 --> 13:26.730
The Witch Amy is using the huge amount of Plannar she gathered from the people of this era,

13:26.730 --> 13:29.820
and is trying to call the worst possible Greater Demon Lord.

13:29.820 --> 13:31.530
The worst Greater Demon Lord?

13:32.380 --> 13:34.660
The Destroyer, Syaimaar.

13:38.700 --> 13:42.130
Syaimaar... the legendary...?

13:47.220 --> 13:56.770
Ah, my great lord Syaimaar-sama, please hurry and come to me, Amy, and destroy everything there is in this world.

13:57.370 --> 14:02.030
Look, I have gathered so much Plannar from those humans.

14:02.030 --> 14:06.900
I will once again start the summoning mechanism and await your coming.

14:07.830 --> 14:13.740
The girl with five of the jewels is a perfect sacrifice for Syaimaar-sama.

14:13.740 --> 14:18.190
Surely, the Jewel of Justice will then lend its power.

14:29.520 --> 14:32.850
I believe Hiiragi-senpai is somewhere looking for me.

14:33.290 --> 14:35.960
So I need to hurry and get out of here as well.

14:45.020 --> 14:46.860
Please, open the door.

14:47.690 --> 14:48.780
Please!

15:00.610 --> 15:03.240
The jewel is... this way.

15:42.930 --> 15:44.250
What are you doing here?!

15:46.140 --> 15:48.270
How did you get here?

15:48.270 --> 15:51.740
You dissolved the seal that I put up.

15:53.190 --> 15:54.200
I see.

15:54.200 --> 15:57.500
So you're here to take the Jewel of Justice away, huh?

15:57.500 --> 15:59.240
I can't let you do that.

15:59.240 --> 16:04.900
I'm going to put the jewels and your Plannar to good use for my master!

16:13.550 --> 16:19.230
Oh Tower of Babel, call forth my master back to this world!

16:35.280 --> 16:39.500
Welcome back, Great Demon Lord Syaimaar-sama!

16:54.010 --> 16:57.770
Ah, my master of old, Syaimaar-sama!

16:58.280 --> 17:05.750
Break apart the seal and please come to my help!

17:17.750 --> 17:20.560
The Plannar?! What is this shock?!

17:30.760 --> 17:33.110
The Plannar Amplifier!!

17:33.110 --> 17:34.280
Syaimaar-sama!!

17:45.290 --> 17:48.830
Syaimaar-sama, I give you fresh Plannar.

17:56.960 --> 17:58.030
Hiiragi-senpai!

17:59.790 --> 18:00.600
What?!

18:03.020 --> 18:06.310
It's you huh? The one who made this stupid tower!

18:06.890 --> 18:09.850
This may be the past, but I'm not going to let a Witch have her way!

18:11.060 --> 18:13.790
How dare you get in the way of Syaimaar-sama's revival!

18:18.310 --> 18:22.120
I didn't think I'd ever have to do this...

18:49.510 --> 18:50.520
Kirihito!

19:03.390 --> 19:09.210
Geez, this world is always exceeding my expectations.

19:14.210 --> 19:16.840
Please wait, Syaimaar-sama!

19:17.440 --> 19:19.510
Syaimaar-sama!!

19:22.000 --> 19:23.440
Master...

19:24.230 --> 19:26.780
And you were so close...

19:27.850 --> 19:29.890
I won't forgive any of you!!

19:29.890 --> 19:31.810
I won't forgive you!

19:32.180 --> 19:32.980
Sphere!

19:34.520 --> 19:35.400
Tornado!

19:37.510 --> 19:38.150
You!

19:39.310 --> 19:42.320
Take this, Ampere of Tears!

19:46.200 --> 19:47.810
Hiiragi-senpai!

19:48.340 --> 19:49.690
My Broom...!

19:52.500 --> 19:54.460
The Jewel of Justice...

19:55.490 --> 19:59.880
My light, give me the power to pierce through justice!

20:11.080 --> 20:12.230
Eyes of All!

20:26.910 --> 20:28.960
Pierce through everything.

20:28.960 --> 20:30.490
My light.

20:35.370 --> 20:36.080
This can't be!

20:42.500 --> 20:43.940
Syaimaar-sama...

20:45.070 --> 20:48.890
My master!!

20:55.300 --> 20:58.520
A half-assed, incomplete summoning system.

20:59.120 --> 21:02.980
Only a piece of Syaimaar was called.

21:02.980 --> 21:07.030
And then it gets destroyed with just a little disturbance.

21:07.660 --> 21:09.840
I don't need this thing.

21:29.310 --> 21:30.250
Elis.

21:35.110 --> 21:37.580
Are we... back?

21:40.420 --> 21:43.070
Ah! You surprised me!

21:43.070 --> 21:46.800
Hiiragi, drawing your sword in a place like this, what're you doing?

21:46.800 --> 21:48.700
No, this is...

21:48.700 --> 21:51.210
Elis, your bracelet...

21:51.210 --> 21:52.250
Y-Yes?

21:52.250 --> 21:54.160
There's another jewel in it.

21:54.700 --> 21:55.510
Yes.

21:56.270 --> 22:00.410
Did something happen while we were throwing out the garbage?!

22:03.740 --> 22:06.260
Just one more left, right?

22:06.260 --> 22:07.490
Yeah...

22:07.490 --> 22:10.010
What's wrong? You don't look so good.

22:10.520 --> 22:13.000
I'm... a little afraid.

22:13.000 --> 22:16.730
I never thought my Broom had so much power.

22:16.730 --> 22:19.400
You wanted to become stronger right?

22:19.400 --> 22:20.820
Yes, but...

22:21.400 --> 22:22.320
But...

22:26.170 --> 22:30.730
Oji-sama, these jewels, just what are they?

22:30.730 --> 22:34.800
And what will happen to me once we've gathered them all?

22:42.920 --> 22:48.780
Shiho Elis went against time, and acquired the Jewel of Justice.

22:48.780 --> 22:53.680
This as well, happened just as was foretold in my book.

22:54.560 --> 22:59.260
That Anzelotte must be very happy right now.

22:59.740 --> 23:01.440
Then let us go and meet them.

23:02.210 --> 23:09.200
Because it is destiny for the last jewel to be in my hand, isn't that right, Leon?

23:11.240 --> 23:16.850
I am sorry Elis-chan, but my playtime with you ends here.

24:50.360 --> 24:53.260
Oji-sama, collecting the jewels has finally come to an end.

24:53.260 --> 25:00.780
In order to get the final jewel and to take the fight to Rikai, Anzelotte-san took the initiative and ordered a sortie!

25:01.490 --> 25:02.860
What is that light?!

25:02.860 --> 25:04.570
The Greater Demon Bell Zephyr?!

25:04.570 --> 25:08.110
Hiiragi-senpai, there's no way we're going to lose, right?!

25:08.110 --> 25:12.740
Next on Night Wizard THE ANIMATION, Pandora's Box, Bell Versus Anzelotte.

25:12.740 --> 25:14.650
School is getting further away!
